+// (v5, ROADMAP 14.1) What the portraits (render/portrait.js) are worked out from that takes long:
+// the pictures of the face's planes and of the lines it makes as it moves, and how the light falls
+// on each point of a head as each of its muscles moves it. Nothing of three.js here: the helper off
+// the game's thread (render/heroworker.js) does all of it, and the game never waits for any of it.
